            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## Service Health and public migration guidance\r\n\r\nThe grid shows capacity-restriction Health Advisories visible to the selected\r\nsubscriptions. An empty grid means no matching advisory is currently retained in\r\nAzure Resource Graph; it does not prove that the subscription has no affected VMs.\r\n\r\nPublic resources:\r\n\r\n* [Previous-generation capacity limitations](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/migration/sizes/previous-gen-series-capacity-limitations)\r\n* [Migration guidance for retired VM sizes](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/lifecycle/retirement/d-ds-dv2-dsv2-ls-series-migration-guide)\r\n* [Resize a virtual machine](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/virtual-machines/sizes/resize-vm)\r\n* [Azure VM Selector](https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/vm-selector/)\r\n* [Azure Pricing Calculator](https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/calculator/)",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "guidanceHeader"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "servicehealthresources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.resourcehealth/events'\n| extend\n    EventType = tostring(properties.EventType),\n    EventSubType = tostring(properties.EventSubType),\n    Status = tostring(properties.Status),\n    Title = tostring(properties.Title),\n    TrackingId = tostring(properties.TrackingId),\n    SummaryHtml = tostring(properties.Summary),\n    EventDate = todatetime(tolong(properties.ImpactMitigationTime))\n| where EventType == 'HealthAdvisory'\n| extend NoticeText = tolower(strcat(Title, ' ', SummaryHtml))\n| where NoticeText contains 'previous-generation'\n    or NoticeText contains 'previous generation'\n    or NoticeText contains 'capacity growth restriction'\n    or NoticeText contains 'v1-v4'\n| extend Summary = trim(' ', replace_regex(SummaryHtml, '<[^>]+>', ' '))\n| project\n    ['Tracking ID'] = TrackingId,\n    Subscription = subscriptionId,\n    Status,\n    Title,\n    Summary,\n    ['Advisory date'] = EventDate\n| order by ['Advisory date'] desc",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Previous-generation VM capacity advisories",
              "queryType": 1,
